this is (another) instance where the NetHack world is not self-contained.
to understand this feature you've had to have played NetHack's predecessor
Rogue.  the level you mentioned, known as the Rogue level, mimics a lot
of the features of Rogue.  some would argue that inside jokes like this
are desirable features ...

btw, the walls you think you are walking thru are Rogue's representation
of doors (which is confusing juxtaposed with NetHack's door usage).

so how do you pick up on these jokes?

